  "state_invariants": [
    "Your legs are locked in a figure-four triangle configuration around opponent's torso, with one leg crossing over the other and the foot tucked securely behind your own knee, creating constant squeezing pressure on their ribcage and diaphragm",
    "Your chest is positioned tight against opponent's back with minimal space between your torso and theirs, maintaining chest-to-back connection that prevents them from turning into you or creating distance",
    "Your hips are positioned on the mat beside opponent's hips (not directly on their back), allowing you to generate leverage and adjust the angle of squeeze while maintaining stability and balance",
    "One or both of your arms control opponent's upper body through collar grips, over-under control, or seatbelt configuration, preventing them from defending their neck while your legs immobilize their lower body",
    "Opponent is on their side or partially turned with their back exposed, unable to effectively turn into you due to the leg lock preventing hip rotation and limiting their mobility options"
  ],
